  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Solar &amp; Energy Storage Project, through Power Engineers, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant is funding a feasibility study for the Thai energy company, Blue Solar Farm 1 Co., Ltd. to support the development of a solar photovoltaic power plant with an integrated energy storage system in Suphan Buri Province, Thailand. The feasibility study will evaluate the technical, financial, and other key elements of the project and provide the necessary analysis and documentation required for financing and implementation. Implementation of the project will support Thailand&apos;s goal to increase private sector investment in the renewable energy sector and help to catalyze new opportunities for energy storage deployment in Southeast Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
